    "result_text": "The test passes.\n\n## Summary\n\nI implemented \"one place that lists all invoices from every project, with its project and stage\" as a small, additive full-stack change.\n\n**No schema/seed change was needed** \u2014 invoices already carry `status` (V5) and belong to a project, and `/__test__` reset/seed already cover clients, projects, and invoices.\n\nWhat I added (all new files, nothing edited centrally):\n\n- **Server endpoint** `src/main/resources/officefloor/rest/api/all-invoices.GET.yml` \u2192 `GET /api/all-invoices` (under `/api/` so it bypasses the SPA fallback).\n- **Logic class** `ListAllInvoices.java` \u2014 joins `invoices` to `projects` to return every invoice across all projects, ordered by id, each with its project name, amount, and status/stage.\n- **View** `AllInvoiceView.java` \u2014 a dedicated read model (id, projectId, projectName, amount, status), keeping the invoices feature decoupled from the project-scoped `InvoiceView`.\n- **Front-end feature** `src/main/frontend/features/invoices/feature.tsx` \u2014 a new page auto-discovered by the manifest router, giving a `nav-invoices` link and an `all-invoices-table` rendering one `invoice-row-<id>` per invoice, each showing `invoice-project` (project name) and `invoice-status` (stage).\n\nThe Playwright acceptance spec passes (`1 passed`). This is a read-only listing, so no `Audit` record is involved.",
